<view class="page compact-form theme-{{theme}}">
  <view class="heading">帮我定个小目标</view><view class="sub">不知道定多大？先回答两个问题，拿一个建议方案。</view>
  <view class="form-field"><view class="field-label">想从什么开始</view><view class="direction-options"><button wx:for="{{directions}}" wx:key="id" class="day-option {{direction === item.id ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="onDirection" aria-label="{{item.label}}{{direction === item.id ? '已选' : '未选'}}">{{item.label}}</button></view></view>
  <view class="form-field"><label class="field-label" for="minutes">每次最多几分钟</label><input id="minutes" class="input {{focusField === 'minutes' ? 'focused' : ''}}" type="number" maxlength="2" value="{{minutes}}" disabled="{{busy}}" data-field="minutes" bindinput="onMinutes" bindfocus="onFieldFocus" bindblur="onFieldBlur" placeholder="1—60分钟" /><view class="sub">1—60分钟，建议不会超过这个时间。</view></view>
  <button class="disclosure spaced" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="onMore" aria-expanded="{{moreOpen}}"><view class="grow"><view>安排在哪些天</view><view class="sub">{{inputSchedule}}</view></view><view class="chevron {{moreOpen ? 'up' : 'down'}}" /></button>
  <view wx:if="{{moreOpen}}">
    <view class="form-field"><view class="field-label">哪些天做</view><view class="week-options"><button wx:for="{{days}}" wx:key="value" class="day-option {{item.selected ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-day="{{item.value}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="onDay" aria-label="周{{item.label}}{{item.selected ? '已选' : '未选'}}">{{item.label}}</button></view><view class="sub spaced">按星期安排，不含节假日调休。</view></view>
    <view class="form-field"><view class="field-label">计划时间（选填）</view><picker mode="time" disabled="{{busy}}" value="{{time || '20:30'}}" bindchange="onTime"><view class="picker picker-select">{{time || '不固定时间'}}<view class="chevron down" /></view></picker><button wx:if="{{time}}" class="text-button" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="onClearTime">不固定时间</button><view class="sub">只用于排序，不会自动提醒。</view></view>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error spaced">{{error}}</view>
  <view class="actions"><button class="primary" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="onRules">给我一个建议</button></view>
  <view class="sub spaced">建议由本机规则生成，不会自动创建习惯或打卡。</view>
  <view wx:if="{{configured}}">
    <view class="notice">云端只接收本页安排；DeepSeek 仅接收方向和可用分钟，不接收执行时间、身份、历史打卡或私人备注。AI在预设动作中选择目标，不保证效果。</view>
    <checkbox-group bindchange="onConsent"><label class="consent"><checkbox value="agree" checked="{{consent}}" disabled="{{busy}}" color="{{primary}}" /><text>同意将本次方向和可用分钟发送给 DeepSeek，仅用于细化计划建议。</text></label></checkbox-group>
    <button class="secondary spaced" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || !consent}}" bindtap="onGenerate">请AI细化建议</button>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{preview}}" id="plan-preview" class="preview">
    <view class="sub">{{preview.source === 'ai' ? 'AI辅助建议 · 请自行核对' : '基础建议 · 非AI生成'}}</view>
    <view class="result-title">{{preview.draft.title}}</view>
    <view class="preview-goals"><text class="goal-main">平时 {{preview.draft.target}}{{preview.draft.unit}}</text><text wx:if="{{preview.draft.minimum}}" class="chip-lime">忙时 {{preview.draft.minimum}}{{preview.draft.unit}}</text></view>
    <view class="sub spaced">{{schedule}}{{preview.draft.time ? ' · ' + preview.draft.time : ''}}</view>
    <view class="sub spaced">{{preview.draft.reason}}</view>
    <button class="disclosure spaced" bindtap="onWhy" aria-expanded="{{whyOpen}}"><text class="grow">为什么这样建议</text><view class="chevron {{whyOpen ? 'up' : 'down'}}" /></button>
    <view wx:if="{{whyOpen}}" class="optional-fields">
      <view class="sub spaced">{{preview.draft.action}}</view>
      <view class="sub">建议由预设动作生成，供参考，不保证效果，也不作为医疗或训练处方；不承诺固定天数养成习惯。</view>
    </view>
    <view class="sub spaced">下一步确认名称、目标和安排，确认后才会创建。</view>
    <button class="primary spaced" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="onAdopt">采用这个计划</button>
  </view>
</view>
